    <apiVersion>61.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <description>After-save on AF_VehicleReservation__c, paired with the before-save AF_FL_Reservation_EvaluateApproval. Submits the record into AF_AP_Reservation_Manager only on the transition into Pending (ISNEW or ISCHANGED), never on a later unrelated save while already Pending, since re-submitting an in-flight approval request errors.

LFRDN-761 fix: AF_AP_Reservation_Manager routes to the Owner&apos;s Manager, but this org&apos;s sharing is Private/BU-group-based, not role-hierarchy - a Manager outside the Opportunity&apos;s BU had no access to the Reservation or its Opportunity (confirmed live, RES-00238/QA ShowroomManager2). Added Get_Owner_User/Get_Manager to resolve the Owner&apos;s Manager, then Share_Reservation_With_Manager and Share_Opportunity_With_Manager (same OpportunityShare/AF_VehicleReservation__c__Share, Edit/Manual pattern as LFRDN-707/728) before Submit_For_Approval, so the resolved approver always has access to both the reservation and its parent deal.</description>
